        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me aryone ma lubo dwogogi i Jerucalem i ot pa Lubaŋa, i dwe me aryo, en aye Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki Yecwa wod pa Jojadak gucako kwede tic, kacel ki utmegigi mukene, kacel ki ajwagi ki Lulevi ki jo ducu ma yam gudok i Jerucalem ma gua ki i lobo ka ma giterogi iye i opii. Guyero Lulevi, ma mwaka me ditogi romo pyeraryo ki makato pi ketogi me bedo ludito ma giloyo tic i kom ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yecwa ki awobene ki lutugi, ki Kadmiel ki awo bene ma likwayo pa Juda, gin ducu guloyo lutic ma i ot pa Lubaŋa, kacel ki awobe pa Kenadad ki Lulevi, ki litinogi kacel ki lutugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
