            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ lugedo guketo guti me te ot pa Rwot, ajwagi guruko ginaruka me tic megi gukato kwede anyim ma gumako tumgi; ki Lulevi ma likwayo pa Acap onoŋo gitye ki atego agoya-gu me pako Rwot, kit ma yam Daudi kabaka me Icrael ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
